{
  "info": {
    "name": "REGINSA API Test - Caso 02 Registrar Sancion",
    "_postman_id": "2d793527-9da1-4898-b3d8-f0db9c8f01a1",
    "description": "Objetivo: validar flujo sancionador Caso 02 extremo a extremo | Reglas: integridad cabecera-medida-detalle y consistencia por RIS | Exito: creacion completa con respuestas funcionales | Evidencia: assertions Postman y XML Newman del caso",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "event": [
    {
      "listen": "prerequest",
      "script": {
        "type": "text/javascript",
        "exec": [
          "const now = Date.now();",
          "const correlativo = now % 100000;",
          "pm.collectionVariables.set('correlativo', String(correlativo));",
          "pm.collectionVariables.set('numero_expediente', `EXP N ${correlativo}-2026`);",
          "pm.collectionVariables.set('numero_resolucion', `RES N ${correlativo}-2026`);",
          "pm.collectionVariables.set('fecha_resolucion', new Date().toISOString());",
          "if (!pm.collectionVariables.get('id_ris')) pm.collectionVariables.set('id_ris', '1');",
          "if (!pm.collectionVariables.get('id_entidad')) pm.collectionVariables.set('id_entidad', '3');"
        ]
      }
    }
  ],
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "id_ris",
      "value": "1"
    },
    {
      "key": "id_entidad",
      "value": "3"
    },
    {
      "key": "cabecera_id",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "id_infraccion",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "display_infraccion",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "numero_expediente",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "numero_resolucion",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "fecha_resolucion",
      "value": ""
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "2) Infraccion/Listar",
      "description": "Objetivo: obtener infraccion aplicable por RIS | Reglas: RIS configurado debe retornar al menos una infraccion | Exito: status 200 y oData con elementos | Evidencia: variables id_infraccion y display_infraccion seteadas",
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/json"
          },
          {
            "key": "Authorization",
            "value": "{{auth_header}}",
            "type": "text"
          }
        ],
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"idRis\": {{id_ris}}\n}"
        },
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{base_api}}/Infraccion/Listar",
          "host": [
            "{{base_api}}"
          ],
          "path": [
            "Infraccion",
            "Listar"
          ]
        }
      },
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "pm.test('Status 200', function () { pm.response.to.have.status(200); });",
              "const body = pm.response.json();",
              "const arr = body?.oData || [];",
              "pm.test('oData no vacio', function () { pm.expect(arr.length).to.be.above(0); });",
              "if (arr.length > 0) {",
              "  pm.collectionVariables.set('id_infraccion', String(arr[0].IdInfraccion));",
              "  pm.collectionVariables.set('display_infraccion', String(arr[0].DisplayInfraccion || 'Infraccion API Test'));",
              "}"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "3) CabeceraInfraccionSancion/Crear",
      "description": "Objetivo: crear cabecera de expediente sancionador | Reglas: entidad, expediente y resolucion deben pasar validaciones backend | Exito: status 200/201 y cabecera_id generado | Evidencia: variable cabecera_id seteada",
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/json"
          },
          {
            "key": "Authorization",
            "value": "{{auth_header}}",
            "type": "text"
          }
        ],
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"IdEntidad\": {{id_entidad}},\n  \"NumeroExpediente\": \"{{numero_expediente}}\",\n  \"NumeroResolucion\": \"{{numero_resolucion}}\",\n  \"FechaResolucion\": \"{{fecha_resolucion}}\",\n  \"RutaResolucionSancion\": \"GENERAL N 00001-2026-SUNEDU-SG-OTI.pdf\",\n  \"ArchivoResolucion\": \"\"\n}"
        },
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{base_api}}/CabeceraInfraccionSancion/Crear",
          "host": [
            "{{base_api}}"
          ],
          "path": [
            "CabeceraInfraccionSancion",
            "Crear"
          ]
        }
      },
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "pm.test('Status 200 o 201', function () { pm.expect([200,201]).to.include(pm.response.code); });",
              "const body = pm.response.json();",
              "let id = body?.oData?.idCabeceraInfraccionSancion;",
              "if (!id && Array.isArray(body?.oData) && body.oData.length > 0) id = body.oData[0].idCabeceraInfraccionSancion;",
              "pm.test('cabecera_id presente', function () { pm.expect(id).to.exist; });",
              "pm.collectionVariables.set('cabecera_id', String(id));"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "4) MedidaCorrectiva/Crear",
      "description": "Objetivo: registrar medida correctiva asociada | Reglas: idCabeceraInfraccionSancion existente y orden valido | Exito: status 200/201 | Evidencia: assertion Status 200 o 201",
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/json"
          },
          {
            "key": "Authorization",
            "value": "{{auth_header}}",
            "type": "text"
          }
        ],
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"idCabeceraInfraccionSancion\": {{cabecera_id}},\n  \"descripcionMedidaCorrectiva\": \"Medida Correctiva API Test\",\n  \"orden\": 1\n}"
        },
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{base_api}}/MedidaCorrectiva/Crear",
          "host": [
            "{{base_api}}"
          ],
          "path": [
            "MedidaCorrectiva",
            "Crear"
          ]
        }
      },
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "pm.test('Status 200 o 201', function () { pm.expect([200,201]).to.include(pm.response.code); });"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "5) DetalleInfraccionSancion/Crear",
      "description": "Objetivo: registrar detalle de infraccion y sancion final | Reglas: infraccion valida para RIS, payload consistente y relacion con cabecera existente | Exito: status 200/201 y bSuccess distinto de false | Evidencia: assertion bSuccess no falso",
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/json"
          },
          {
            "key": "Authorization",
            "value": "{{auth_header}}",
            "type": "text"
          }
        ],
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"idCabeceraInfraccionSancion\": {{cabecera_id}},\n  \"IdInfraccion\": {{id_infraccion}},\n  \"desInfraccion\": \"{{display_infraccion}}\",\n  \"desSancion\": \"Multa\",\n  \"bitCancelacion\": 0,\n  \"canSuspension\": 0,\n  \"tipoMulta\": \"SOLES\",\n  \"numMonto\": 1000,\n  \"bitReconsidera\": 0,\n  \"bitReincidente\": 0,\n  \"bitPago\": 0,\n  \"desSuspension\": null,\n  \"desHechoInfractor\": \"Hecho Infractor API Test\",\n  \"numCorrelativo\": 1,\n  \"bitMedida\": 1,\n  \"desMedidaCorrectivaGen\": \"Medida Correctiva API Test\",\n  \"idRis\": {{id_ris}},\n  \"tempId\": -2\n}"
        },
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{base_api}}/DetalleInfraccionSancion/Crear",
          "host": [
            "{{base_api}}"
          ],
          "path": [
            "DetalleInfraccionSancion",
            "Crear"
          ]
        }
      },
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "pm.test('Status 200 o 201', function () { pm.expect([200,201]).to.include(pm.response.code); });",
              "const body = pm.response.json();",
              "pm.test('bSuccess no falso', function () { pm.expect(body?.bSuccess).to.not.eql(false); });"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}